{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13205","headline":"送李万州赴饶州觐省 · 皇甫冉","name":"送李万州赴饶州觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前程观拜庆，旧馆惜招携。\n荀氏风流远，胡家清白齐。\n川回吴岫失，塞阔楚云低。\n举目亲鱼鸟，惊心怯鼓鼙。\n人稀渔浦外，滩浅定山西。\n无限青青草，王孙去不迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}